\date{2025-11-03T00:05:19Z}
\title{Swarm typing judgments}
\tag{swarm}
\tag{note}

\import{swarm-macros}

\p{Swarm has two basic typing judgments: a [top-level judgment](001M) that assigns capability-annotated [polytypes](001N), and a basic judgment that assigns [monotypes](000Y) to terms and collects the [capabilities](001D) needed to evaluate them.}

